      },
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "textUthmani": "الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِينَ",
      "textEnglishTranslation": "[All] praise is [due] to Allah, Lord of the worlds -",
      "keywords": [
