      "opinionEnglish": "Al-Asr signifies the totality of time, the passage of day and night (Ad-Dahr). Allah swears by time because human endeavor, triumph, and ruin are all manifested within its temporal continuum.",
      "opinionArabic": "المراد بالعصر الدهر ومرور الليل والنهار، أقسم الله به لأن فيه معتبرًا بمرور الآجال وانقضاء الأعمار وتبدل الأحوال.",
      "divergenceType": "complementary",
      "evidenceEnglish": "Classical Arabic linguistics and narrations from Ibn Abbas confirming time as the overarching vessel of human accountability."
    },
    {
